WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:02.480
¿Qué?

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.440
Gooseberries.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.320
The whole room smells of them.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.440
Zachary.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.240
Look, whatever happened

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.280
last night,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.320
this club and my sister...

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:20.280
I don't remember much, so...

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.120
I should just, you know...

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.680
I can't remember anything either.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.240
Except you.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.560
Maybe I should remind you

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.120
how it felt

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.920
when I was inside of you.
